<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <h2 style="color: #22c55e;">Mesaj nou din formularul de contact</h2>
  <div style="background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
    <p><strong>Nume:</strong> {{name}}</p>
    <p><strong>Email:</strong> {{email}}</p>
    <p><strong>Subiect:</strong> {{subject}}</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background-color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px;">
    <h3 style="color: #374151; margin-top: 0;">Mesaj:</h3>
    <p style="color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;">{{nl2br message}}</p>
  </div>
  <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 20px;">
    Acest email a fost trimis automat din formularul de contact de pe site-ul Asociația Green Space.
  </p>
</div>
